Missing event catalogue entries: none
Extra event catalogue entries: none
Deliberate event workflow exclusions:
- InputVolumeMeters: High-volume meter stream; not useful as a default LLM-facing workflow confirmation.
- InputActiveStateChanged: High-volume activity signal; direct read tools are safer unless a debounced aggregate is designed.
- InputShowStateChanged: High-volume UI/showing signal; direct read tools are safer unless a debounced aggregate is designed.
- SceneItemTransformChanged: High-volume transform stream; needs an opt-in aggregate/debounce design before public exposure.
- VendorEvent: Plugin-defined raw payload surface; only useful with plugin-specific documentation and schemas.
- CustomEvent: Arbitrary raw custom payload surface; not a general MCP workflow confirmation.
- ExitStarted: Race-prone shutdown signal with weak workflow semantics for this server.
- ScreenshotSaved: OBS hotkey screenshot-output event, not confirmation for obs-mcp screenshot tools.

